@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Shipment - Choose Delivery Method

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Seller|
start
note right
Precondition:
The seller is signed in and approved.

Postcondition:
The method and the carrier are stored with the shipment.
end note
:Open the delivery choice while creating a shipment;
|System|
:Display both methods and the active carriers;
|Seller|
repeat
:Choose self delivery, or platform delivery with a carrier;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Seller|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check the choice when the shipment is created;
backward :Return the validation error;
repeat while (Self delivery has a carrier,\nplatform delivery has none or\nthe carrier is inactive?) is (Yes) not (No)
|Seller|
:View the result;
stop

@enduml
